window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>#4 in the Mafia Kings dark mafia romance series!</p> <p>Duet narration by Tor Thom and Kylie Stewart, with additional narration by CJ Bloom.</p> <p>Rachel</p> <p>He was the most handsome man I’d ever met…A Special Forces soldier deployed in Afghanistan.</p> <p>I fell for him almost immediately.</p> <p>He sacrificed so much so that we could be together…But secrets tore us apart.</p> <p>Now I’ve got a new job:</p> <p>Destroying the people he works for.</p> <p>He was the one who got away…And now I might have to kill him.</p> <p>Lars</p> <p>She was the most beautiful woman I’d ever met…A British intelligence agent chasing terrorists.</p> <p>I fell in love with her our very first night together.</p> <p>I did everything to be with her…But fate intervened and we were driven apart.</p> <p>I thought it was over.</p> <p>Now she’s come back into my life…But as an enemy to the people who took me in as family.</p> <p>She was the one who got away…And now I might have to kill her.</p> <p>Mafia Kings: Lars is the fourth in a dark Mafia Romance series.</p> <p>#1 – Mafia Kings: Dario</p> <p>#2 – Mafia Kings: Adriano</p> <p>#3 – Mafia Kings: Massimo</p> <p>#4 – Mafia Kings: Lars</p> <p>There is NO cheating or OWD (other woman drama). There IS an HEA.</p> <p>Warning: This book contains adult situations, profanity, violence, and dark romance themes.</p>"; 
